khash.h is the unmodified khash 0.2.8 header from klib commit
97a0fcb790b43b9e5da8994f4671021fec036f19:
https://github.com/attractivechaos/klib/blob/97a0fcb790b43b9e5da8994f4671021fec036f19/khash.h

Copyright and MIT license terms are retained in khash.h and distributed in
java.base's legal/klib.md. HotSpot's allocator and scalar-only interface are
provided by utilities/khashTable.inline.hpp; the upstream hash implementation
is unchanged.
